
//- section
mixin section-convenient()
  section.section-convenient.section#section-convenient

    //- 背景插圖
    .section-convenient--bg-left
      .section-convenient--bg-left__pic.section-convenient--bg-left_1
        img(src='images/reuse/pink-leaves-sm.svg' alt='leaf')
      .section-convenient--bg-left__pic.section-convenient--bg-left_2
        img(src='images/reuse/brown-leaves.svg' alt='leaf')
    .section-convenient--bg-right
      .section-convenient--bg-right__pic.section-convenient--bg-right_1
        img(src='images/reuse/green-leaves.svg' alt='leaf')
      .section-convenient--bg-right__pic.section-convenient--bg-right_2
        img(src='images/reuse/yellow-flower.svg' alt='leaf')

    //- 最大寬度1300
    .wrap__inner
      h2.section-title(data-aos='fade-up' data-aos-duration='1200')
        img(src='images/title-convenient.svg' alt='網銀會員好方便')
        img.leaf-yellow(src='images/title-leaf-yellow.svg' alt='leaf')
        img.leaf-red(src='images/title-leaf-red.svg' alt='leaf')

      //- 預設文字是Noto Sans
      .section-subtitle.center(data-aos='fade-up' data-aos-duration='1400') 手機能做到的事，何必出門辦理

      .section-convenient--box(data-aos='fade-up' data-aos-duration='1600')
        .section-convenient--card
          .center
            .section-convenient--card__title.noto-700 轉帳
            .section-convenient--card__img
              img(src='images/convenient-transfer.svg' alt='轉帳')
            .section-convenient--card__info 免跑臨櫃、ATM，預約轉、即時轉，轉帳的事交由手機搞定

        .section-convenient--card
          .center
            .section-convenient--card__title.noto-700 無卡提款
            .section-convenient--card__img
              img(src='images/convenient-cardless.svg' alt='無卡提款')
            .section-convenient--card__info 不想帶金融卡/忘記帶金融卡
              |
              br
              | 提款的事交由手機搞定

        .section-convenient--card
          .center
            .section-convenient--card__title.noto-700 繳費
            .section-convenient--card__img
              img(src='images/convenient-pay.svg' alt='繳費')
            .section-convenient--card__info 免跑超商、ATM
              |
              br
              | 繳費的事交由手機搞定

        .section-convenient--card
          .center
            .section-convenient--card__title.noto-700 外幣買賣
            .section-convenient--card__img
              img(src='images/convenient-foreignCurrency.svg' alt='外幣買賣')
            .section-convenient--card__info 隨時換匯，輕鬆便利
              |
              br
              | 換匯的事交由手機搞定


        //- .section-convenient--transfer
        //- .section-convenient--cardless
        //- .section-convenient--pay
        //- .section-convenient--foreignCurrency


